These parameters are chosen starting values. They are not fitted to this dataset, and their computed probabilities are uncalibrated. The native scorer evaluates the frozen likelihood ratios without unsupervised training or term-frequency adjustments. The runtime migration preserves the resolution policy and makes no accuracy claim.

